{"4167200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UN:Me", "steam_appid": 4167200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Purpose// The truth is in the dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue is how you reach them. Every soul insists that it is the real one, the body’s rightful owner, and the way to test that claim is to sit with each in turn, question it, and weigh what it says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every exchange, a blank presence sharpens into someone specific, with a voice, expressions, and memories all its own. The better you come to know them, the harder your task becomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Story// Erase the &quot;Me&quot; they claim. Find the &quot;I&quot; that remains.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl wakes in a world that is beautiful and wrong. Four voices crowd her mind, each a human soul adrift here, and each set on seizing her body to live out its own will. What are these four souls? Who is the girl they all claim to be? Talk with them, face the trauma each one carries, and press deeper into this world to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/dc2220c72eeb5c9a048da733aef3e930.avif?t=1787708608\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras_big/dc2220c72eeb5c9a048da733aef3e930.webp?t=1787708608 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Dialogue// What you ask changes them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The souls wake with no memory, holding only the certainty that the body is theirs. You search the unstable world for fragments of their past, and every fragment you recover opens new questions to put to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak, the choice is yours and the clock is running, so what you ask, and how you choose to ask it, carries real weight. Press or soothe a soul, provoke it or reassure it, and it slowly recovers its “self,” while the unstable world bends in answer to how you treat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Exploration// An unstable world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The souls do not wait for permission. In third person you guide the girl through this world, but any soul can rise and take her body without warning, and whichever one holds control decides what she can do and where she can go. One soul opens a path another cannot reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the world never holds still. To recover every fragment of memory, you learn to work with whichever soul surfaces, and to move through a place that keeps rearranging itself around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Anxiety// The trauma drives each soul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of them is scarred by something in its past, and those wounds do not stay buried. Explore too long as one soul, and its trauma tears open mid-step: her vision swims, sound curdles, and her body stops answering the way it should. A soul that has not yet recovered its “self” has nothing to fight back with. All you can do is run. And if it catches you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Erasure// There’s no going back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one soul can stay in a single body. The rest cannot. You will come to know each of them, their fears, their tempers, the people they might once have been. And then the choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was your judgment right, or was it wrong? That may be the hardest answer to live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Purpose// The truth is in the dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue is how you reach them. Every soul insists that it is the real one, the body’s rightful owner, and the way to test that claim is to sit with each in turn, question it, and weigh what it says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every exchange, a blank presence sharpens into someone specific, with a voice, expressions, and memories all its own. The better you come to know them, the harder your task becomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/b32847550925b53ff315ae614a4e5315.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Story// Erase the &quot;Me&quot; they claim. Find the &quot;I&quot; that remains.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl wakes in a world that is beautiful and wrong. Four voices crowd her mind, each a human soul adrift here, and each set on seizing her body to live out its own will. What are these four souls? Who is the girl they all claim to be? Talk with them, face the trauma each one carries, and press deeper into this world to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/dc2220c72eeb5c9a048da733aef3e930.avif?t=1787708608\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras_big/dc2220c72eeb5c9a048da733aef3e930.webp?t=1787708608 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Dialogue// What you ask changes them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The souls wake with no memory, holding only the certainty that the body is theirs. You search the unstable world for fragments of their past, and every fragment you recover opens new questions to put to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you speak, the choice is yours and the clock is running, so what you ask, and how you choose to ask it, carries real weight. Press or soothe a soul, provoke it or reassure it, and it slowly recovers its “self,” while the unstable world bends in answer to how you treat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/6d16dde9e5a9fe6c34cc9155bbcf553f.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Exploration// An unstable world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The souls do not wait for permission. In third person you guide the girl through this world, but any soul can rise and take her body without warning, and whichever one holds control decides what she can do and where she can go. One soul opens a path another cannot reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the world never holds still. To recover every fragment of memory, you learn to work with whichever soul surfaces, and to move through a place that keeps rearranging itself around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d77e889625f31c9a17c8d1b7df6e5727.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Anxiety// The trauma drives each soul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of them is scarred by something in its past, and those wounds do not stay buried. Explore too long as one soul, and its trauma tears open mid-step: her vision swims, sound curdles, and her body stops answering the way it should. A soul that has not yet recovered its “self” has nothing to fight back with. All you can do is run. And if it catches you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/d91b7794aacf1c2be2fc51c9eac200b7.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//Erasure// There’s no going back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one soul can stay in a single body. The rest cannot. You will come to know each of them, their fears, their tempers, the people they might once have been. And then the choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was your judgment right, or was it wrong? That may be the hardest answer to live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.poster.avif?t=1787708608\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.webm?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/extras/a3920387329eabaf991150898c86346a.mp4?t=1787708608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "UN:Me is a soul triage adventure. Four souls share one girl’s body, each certain it is the real one, yet only one can remain. Through dialogue you search a beautiful, unsettling world for its true owner, fleeing the traumas that surface as you go. When only one can stay, which will you keep?", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/96506016d3890ffdf812bd97b58d8a525eb04c6f/header.jpg?t=1787708608", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/34ffcec2c23f193aaad9218e41814a8f1a5f7629/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787708608", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/34ffcec2c23f193aaad9218e41814a8f1a5f7629/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787708608", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©SHUEISHA,SHUEISHA GAMES developed by historia ", "developers": [" historia Inc."], "publishers": ["SHUEISHA GAMES"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167200/61c36c57e71ea0ef1519bee98daf11a1e7f55c6b/ss_61c36c57e71ea0ef1519bee9